<title>JAPAN: Aigan - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Aigan - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 12.53		vs	   12.07</p>
<p> Operating	  934 million	 vs	  950 million</p>
<p> Current	    904 million	 vs	    1.02</p>
<p> Net		  519 million	 vs	  366 million</p>
<p> EPS		   24.64 yen	  vs	   17.38 yen</p>
<p> Shares		21 million	 vs	   21 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  6.00 yen	  vs	    6.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Aigan Co Ltd is a retailer of glasses and optical products.</p>
</text>
